invariant: INV-13
file: io.c
catches: unit
reason: io_send_all takes a count above the bytes it handed the send, so
  the count of bytes left wraps and the loop calls the send past the end
  of the record. bin/unit's send that answers n + 1 once counts the
  second call.

--- old
        if (sent <= 0 || (size_t)sent > n) {
--- new
        if (sent <= 0) {
